# Sanguine Indulgence: "This spell costs {3} less to cast if you've gained 3 or more life this turn." (CR 601.2f, 118.7, 119.3) The life gained is added up over the whole turn. Bot1 shrinks both of their own
# Memnites with two Moments of Craving, gaining 2 life each time (20 -> 24, neither gain being 3 on its own). Sanguine Indulgence then costs just {B} (the Mox Jet, nothing left in the pool)
# and brings both Memnites back to hand.

